******************************************************************** MESSAGES

@M001
@
The allowable choices are:
    c -- convert TKF file to another format
    f -- redirect printer dump to a file
    l -- large, low resolution plot
    L -- large, high resolution plot
    m -- medium sized, low resolution plot
    M -- medium sized, high resolution plot
@

@M002
@    n -- PLAY a new TKF file
@

@M003
@    p -- change printer selections
    q -- quit and close files
    s -- color separation output
    v -- vary PostScript parameters
    w -- shrink picture to fit window
    z -- zoom marked area to fill screen
@

@M004
@    1 thru 9 -- skip n pictures
@

